<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    «Добавить подписку» — the whole menu, and it is two items.

    Inflated as a PopupMenu by MainActivity.showImportMenu(), anchored to Главная's add control.
    The owner cut it to this on 2026-07-27: «Tapping "Добавить подписку" offers scan QR, clipboard,
    enter link, create manually, import from file, send to TV. It must offer QR and clipboard, and
    nothing else.» A customer of departament adds a подписка by scanning the bot's QR or by pasting
    the link the bot sent — those are the two, and a menu of six made the two hard to find.

    Where the other four went:

      «Отправить на телевизор»  -> Настройки · Устройства (SettingsTabFragment.rowTvSend). It was
                                   already there; this entry was a duplicate.
      «Ввести ссылку»           -> MainHost.showAdvancedAddMethods(), the power-user picker. The
      «Создать вручную»            three still work, unchanged; only their entry point moved off
      «Импортировать из файла»     the add menu, which is a subscription action, not a lab.

    The `group_server_list` group that used to sit below — locate / sort / export / three bulk
    deletes — is gone with the Серверы destination the owner removed on 2026-07-26. Its handlers
    went with the tab, so every one of those items had become an id nothing dispatched.

    Item ids are consumed by MainActivity.onOptionsItemSelected.
-->
<menu xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"
    xmlns:app="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res-auto">

    <group android:id="@+id/group_import">
        <item
            android:id="@+id/import_qrcode"
            android:icon="@drawable/ic_scan_24dp"
            android:title="@string/menu_add_scan_qr"
            app:showAsAction="never" />
        <item
            android:id="@+id/import_clipboard"
            android:icon="@drawable/ic_dl_copy"
            android:title="@string/menu_add_clipboard"
            app:showAsAction="never" />
    </group>

</menu>
